---
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left: Content -->
      <div>
        <span class="text-primary-400 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">About Us</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white">
          Partner Teknologi yang
          <span class="text-primary-400">Dapat Diandalkan</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-dark-300 leading-relaxed">
          Lookita Tech adalah perusahaan teknologi yang berfokus pada pengembangan solusi digital inovatif. Kami membantu bisnis dari berbagai skala untuk bertransformasi secara digital melalui layanan pengembangan web & aplikasi, infrastruktur cloud, desain UI/UX, dan konsultasi IT.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-dark-300 leading-relaxed">
          Dengan tim yang berpengalaman dan passionate terhadap teknologi, kami berkomitmen memberikan solusi yang tidak hanya fungsional, tetapi juga scalable dan maintainable untuk jangka panjang.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          {[
            { icon: '⚡', title: 'Fast Delivery', desc: 'Proses pengembangan cepat dan efisien' },
            { icon: '🔒', title: 'Secure & Reliable', desc: 'Keamanan dan keandalan terjamin' },
            { icon: '📈', title: 'Scalable', desc: 'Solusi yang tumbuh bersama bisnis Anda' },
            { icon: '🤝', title: 'Collaborative', desc: 'Kerjasama transparan di setiap tahap' },
          ].map((item) => (
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-2xl">{item.icon}</span>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">{item.title}</h4>
                <p class="text-dark-400 text-xs mt-1">{item.desc}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Visual -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-600/20 to-primary-900/20 border border-white/5 p-8 flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="w-full max-w-sm space-y-4">
            {/* Code-like visual */}
            <div class="bg-dark-900/80 rounded-xl p-4 border border-white/5">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/80"></span>
                <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/80"></span>
                <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/80"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="space-y-2 font-mono text-xs">
                <div><span class="text-primary-400">const</span> <span class="text-green-400">lookita</span> = {`{`}</div>
                <div class="pl-4"><span class="text-dark-300">mission:</span> <span class="text-amber-300">"Digital Innovation"</span>,</div>
                <div class="pl-4"><span class="text-dark-300">focus:</span> <span class="text-amber-300">"Your Success"</span>,</div>
                <div class="pl-4"><span class="text-dark-300">tech:</span> [<span class="text-amber-300">"modern"</span>, <span class="text-amber-300">"scalable"</span>],</div>
                <div>{`}`}</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-dark-900/80 rounded-xl p-4 border border-white/5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-dark-400 text-xs">Build Status</span>
                <span class="text-green-400 text-xs flex items-center gap-1">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
                  Passing
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-2 w-full bg-dark-800 rounded-full h-2">
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-500 to-green-400 h-2 rounded-full" style="width: 100%"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 w-24 h-24 bg-primary-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -left-4 w-32 h-32 bg-primary-600/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
